> A hand-checkable calculation

A weight with mean2 and scale.5 becomes1.5,2,2.5 for noise-1,0,+1. Evaluation sets the noise multiplier to zero; learned sigma is not an epsilon schedule.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/noisy_networks_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
